# Figma FO UI

When editing `figma.com/design/ZJ0oXFLXCOFOXQsLxE86Vh` or pin/token docs:

1. Read `.agents/skills/figma-fo-ui/SKILL.md` before any `use_figma` mutation. Also load Figma plugin skills `figma-use` + `figma-generate-design`.
2. A **pin** is a **red numbered dot attached to the screenshot and/or new UI** it annotates — not a docs card, not legend-only.
3. Pins **never overlap**, never cover important text; numbers may restart at 1 on each band.
4. Legend is title + description only; every legend row must **HUG** vertically (never fixed-height rows — that overlaps text). Optional thin connectors pin→legend when readable.
5. Keep catalog ids (`opt.*` / `host.*` / `plan.*`) in the legend/docs tables; sync `docs/developer/ui-figma-map.md`.
6. Screenshot and fix ambiguity before finishing.
